{"title": "List of equipment sets", "pageid": 34349, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/List_of_equipment_sets", "categories": ["Lists", "Lists of equipment"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The following sub-pages list sets of <a href=\"/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">equipment</a>. Equipment sets are groups of armour, weapons, or accessories which have similar themes or effects.\n</p><p>See also: <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Equipment_sets\" title=\"Category:Equipment sets\">Category:Equipment sets</a>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_equipment_sets/Ability_scores\" title=\"List of equipment sets/Ability scores\">Ability scores</a>: Sets by character <a href=\"/wiki/Ability\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability\">ability</a> score</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_equipment_sets/Classes\" title=\"List of equipment sets/Classes\">Classes</a>: Sets by character <a href=\"/wiki/Class\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Class\">class</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_equipment_sets/Damage_types\" title=\"List of equipment sets/Damage types\">Damage types</a>: Sets by <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_type\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage type\">damage type</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_equipment_sets/Game_mechanics\" title=\"List of equipment sets/Game mechanics\">Game mechanics</a>: Sets by gameplay mechanics</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_equipment_sets/Races\" title=\"List of equipment sets/Races\">Races</a>: Sets by <a href=\"/wiki/Race\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Race\">race</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/List_of_equipment_sets/Other\" title=\"List of equipment sets/Other\">Other</a>: Miscellaneous equipment sets</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201554\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.002 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.002 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/4194304 bytes\nTemplate a